loom guards_green=10 refs_lost=192 ceiling=192 reds_bytes=20890
file recursion-prompts/seed/autonomous-loop.seed.md the 5x3 grid, the bench, and the two loops
file foundations/20260821-211423_galls-law-and-the-grown-system.md cited six times, argued now
file foundations/20260821-211423_conways-law-and-the-organization-that-forgets.md zero mentions before this
file tools/radiant_negation_witness.rish the register gains a ratchet and a red path on metal
file recursion-prompts/versions/20260821-211943_autonomous-loop-caravan-and-the-grid.md the filled loop
file tools/launch-claude-season.rish both printed forms carry the grid and the meter
file crux/REMEMBER.md the reshape row, the first door repointed, two guards added to the equipment
recommend check-in (Keaton) the grid, the graduates, the two foundations, and the meter all stand green, and the loop is filled and pointed. Worth one look at the grid's assignments before the run starts, since the element-and-modality placement is his design language rather than mine, and a slot moved now costs one line where a slot moved later costs a cycle.
